[NRTM.6.1] A `realtime` artefact's contract is summarised in a small binding
tuple the integrator can read and compare:

```c
typedef struct ds_rt_config_binding {
    char rt_config_sha256[65]; /* hex; "" when no contract is loaded */
} ds_rt_config_binding_t;

ds_rt_config_binding_t b;
ds_engine_get_rt_config_binding(engine, &b);
```
